{"symbol":"GPAPL","yahoo":"GPAPL.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"sme":null,"name":"Gujarat Peanut and Agri Products Limited","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Farm Products","website":"https://www.gujaratpeanut.com","about":"Gujarat Peanut and Agri Products Limited engages in manufacturing, cleaning, grading, processing, sorting, buying, selling, trading, and marketing of agricultural produce and commodities in India. It offers peanuts and peanut products, including groundnut in-shell, groundnut oil, groundnut seeds, groundnut split, groundnut husk, blanched peanut, and peanut rejection; and black sesame, hulled sesame, sesame, and watermelon seeds. The company also provides various spices, such as coriander seeds, cumin seeds, fenugreek, fennel seeds, mustard seeds, and kalonji; and food grains and pulses, which include brown eye beans, chickpeas, green moong, kidney beans, moong dal, pigeon peas, red lentils, urad dal, toor dal, yellow peas, and soybean. It also exports its products to the United Arab Emirates, China, Thailand, Indonesia, Iraq, Iran, Poland, Kosovo, and Lebanon. The company was incorporated in 2005 and is based in Rajkot, India.","updated":"2026-10-03T12:46:25+00:00","quote":{"price":75.0,"prevClose":78.93,"marketCap":76.96,"high52":99.54,"low52":63.84,"pe":8.92,"bookValue":49.2,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":21.16,"shares":1.0262,"insiders":77.24,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2025-10-03","2025-10-06","2025-10-07","2025-10-08","2025-10-09","2025-10-10","2025-10-13","2025-10-14","2025-10-15","2025-10-16","2025-10-17","2025-10-20","2025-10-21","2025-10-23","2025-10-24","2025-10-27","2025-10-28","2025-10-29","2025-10-30","2025-10-31","2025-11-03","2025-11-04","2025-11-06","2025-11-07","2025-11-10","2025-11-11","2025-11-12","2025-11-13","2025-11-14","2025-11-17","2025-11-18","2025-11-19","2025-11-20","2025-11-21","2025-11-24","2025-11-25","2025-11-26","2025-11-27","2025-11-28","2025-12-01","2025-12-02","2025-12-03","2025-12-04","2025-12-05","2